<title>SWEDEN: Trygg-Hansa posts 2.1 bln SKR 9 mo pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Trygg-Hansa posts 2.1 bln SKR 9 mo pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish insurer Trygg-Hansa AB on Friday reported for the nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		    (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			   2,101 vs 2,088</p>
<p> Profit/share after tax(skr)	  20.10 vs 21.80</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds		    8,882 vs 6,947+</p>
<p> Premium income, gross		  8,534 vs 8,563</p>
<p> Premium income, non-life	     4,665 vs 5,196</p>
<p> Technical result, non-life	     583 vs   479</p>
<p> Premium income, life		     589 vs   446</p>
<p> Technical results, life	    LOSS 25 vs     0</p>
<p> Direct yield*			    1,078 vs 1,153</p>
<p> Capital gain, unrealised changes   1,596 vs 1,613</p>
<p> Changes in surplus values	 CHARGE 4 vs   329 CREDIT</p>
<p> Total investment return		2,670 vs 3,095</p>
<p> Total assets			    34,140 vs 27,807</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity		   7,771 vs 6,289</p>
<p> Surplus values			     557 vs   561</p>
<p> Deferred tax liability		   554 vs    97</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds/share (SKR)	108 vs    84</p>
<p> Tax					    444 vs   282</p>
<p> Minorities				     0 vs     4</p>
<p> Result after tax			 1,657 vs 1,802</p>
<p>+=Comparison figures exclude the company's acquired as per January 1, 1996, namely Trygg-Banken, Fri Placering, Trygg Fonder, except for written premiums which pertain to all of Trygg-Hansa's operations. *=after deducting operating expenses</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of insurance group is Trygg-Hansa AB.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
